    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65794" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελάγ-χροος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελάγ-χρους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, heterocl. nom. pl. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
