				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.104
				</span></i>
			:—<i>black-skinned, swarthy</i>, of sunburnt
			persons, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.2.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3pp.1,19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arat.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. κόσσυφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Numen.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.315b
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαγχροιής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, of a
