				Od.
				16.175
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαγχρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, as pr. n., <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				21
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελάγχρως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωτος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				321
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hec.</u>
				1106
			</span></i> (lyr., 
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελανό</span>
			-), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				253e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.19
			</span></i>,al. <span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc.:—Com. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαγχρής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				425
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				430
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				974
			</span></i>, Anon.<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
			</span></i> in Gerhard <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phoinix</u>
				p.7
			</span></i>, also <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				76.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
